78,3,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I will support Option C, but I insist we finalize the specific seat assignments now. Let's be transparent about the window seats so that the final layout is based on a fair agreement, not just luck.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shion,,"Fairness is a subjective distraction. The only objective requirement is a stable, quiet environment to maintain ergonomic and auditory focus. I've made my choice; let's simply finalize the map and end this.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
