81,3,4,talk,Yumi,,I'm so happy we all agree! Let's make sure we pick our seats together so we can all be close and supportive of one another. I can't wait to see our new layout!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
